  "goodToKnow": "Einbinden is separable and irregular (er bindet ein, band ein, hat eingebunden). It means to integrate or involve someone: Wir wollen die Bürger in die Entscheidung einbinden. In IT, to embed a file or video on a page. A traditional meaning is to bind a book, and der Einband is the cover. The noun die Einbindung is common in project and company language. Gut eingebunden sein means being well integrated into a team."
